The restaurant consumer pullback of 2025 hasn’t been kind to the fast-casual segment, as evidenced especially by Chipotle’s recent challenges. CAVA also seems to be feeling the effects, reporting on Tuesday a same-store sales increase of 1.9% in the third quarter and a 20% increase in revenue — both of which were below Wall Street forecasts. Traffic in the quarter was flat.&nbsp;

