Sweetgreen — the Los Angeles-based, fast-casual salad chain — announced the appointment this week of former Chipotle executive Jamie McConnell as chief financial officer. McConnell joins Sweetgreen as Mitch Reback, who served as Sweetgreen CFO for the past 10 years, announces his retirement.&nbsp;

